<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thank You, Father, for sending Him;</l><l>The Spirit of Your Son Who cries within.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh! How sweet is Abba’s Name</l><l>From our spirit through our heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Every moment this mingled cry;</l><l>To Your Beloved we’re joined thereby.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Day by day, this cry so new;</l><l>In Your Son we come back to You.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>In Your bosom here we’ll stay,</l><l>In Your Son and never stray.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
